#X msg 110 513 @mode;
#X text 245 513 Получить/Установить output mode. 'full' - output the
convolution at each point of overlap \, with an output length of (M+N-1).
At the end-points of the convolution \, the signals do not overlap
completely \, and boundary effects may be seen. 'valid' - output of
length (max(M \, N)-min(M \, N)+1). The convolution product is only
given for points where the signals overlap completely. Values outside
the signal boundary have no effect. 'same' - output of length max(M
\, N). Boundary effects are still visible. Тип: symbol. Значение по
умолчанию: full. Разрешённые значения: valid \, same \, full.;
